{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Three Routes: Run &amp; Walk 是一款結合路線規劃、GPS 步行與跑步記錄、5K 或 10K 訓練計劃、力量與伸展練習的運動 App，適合想規劃日常步行或跑步路線、建立穩定運動習慣的用戶。其終生版內購現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $19.99，完成初始化後可在收費牆查看 Lifetime 價格是否為 $0。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-161.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>路線規劃與運動記錄</h2>\n<p>Three Routes 支援步行與跑步路線規劃，透過 Apple Maps 行人導航探索最多三條路線，可設定距離、時間、環形或 Out &amp; Back 路線。另備 5K 與 10K 訓練計劃、GPS 記錄、Apple Watch 語音及觸覺提示、力量訓練與六式伸展，並可查看歷史、每週目標與活動連續紀錄，亦可將運動及路線存入 Apple Health。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-302-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-303-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-304-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-305-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-306-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-307-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>Three Routes: Run &amp; Walk 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Three Routes: Run &amp; Walk</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/three-routes-run-walk/id6823810305\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:12.081572+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":534,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T09:04:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T04:18:28.157753+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:33.542468+00:00","content_hash":"b827b69a82956d2bd485150653de6e991b221d3f32c3690910ac7e0f97b50f87","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}